    "purpose": "Single declared truth for which firmware modules are host-tested, per project. run-host-tests.ps1 builds one test runner per project from here; static-check.ps1 asserts that CMakeLists.txt, each project's runner and this file agree, and that every host-compilable module is declared. v2 (spec 0002 T-005): projects[] replaces the single-project fields; each project gets its own logic lib and runner executable so identical module names in different projects never collide.",
